		"title": "BA1 Studies",
		"description": [
			"A collection of explorations from my first year, each telling a different story through fabric and form.",
			"These studies represent my early investigations into identity, memory, and social consciousness through fashion design.",
			"From tartan rebellion to delicate remembrance, each piece explores how clothing can carry meaning beyond its material form."
		],
		"date": "2023",
		"credits": {
